              "name": "Jillian"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great for large parties, as this does make a lot! I used Hellman's light mayo (about a cup) and reduced fat sour cream (about a cup and a half) as I wanted more of the \"ranch\" flavor. It was perfect for assorted veggies, crackers, and chips for dipping."
